{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20337","headline":"哭于鹄 · 张籍","name":"哭于鹄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青山无逸人，忽觉大国贫。\n良玉沈幽泉，名爲天下珍。\n野性疎时俗，再拜乃从军。\n气高终不合，去如镜上尘。\n我初有章句，相合者唯君。\n今来吊嗣子，对陇烧新文。\n耕者废其耜，爨者绝其薪。\n苟无新衣裳，曷用光我身。\n奠酒徒拜手，哀怀安能陈。\n徒保金石韵，千载人所闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}